--- Apply Instructions ---
1. Create auth.ts store in website/src/lib/stores/
2. Modify app +layout.svelte to check auth before rendering
3. Create UserMenu.svelte component
4. Add UserMenu to the toolbar/header component
5. Create LoadingSpinner.svelte if not exists

Session expiration handling:
- The auth store can be extended to periodically check session validity
- On 401 responses from API calls, redirect to login
